i-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.80 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 - 2,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050605194403&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Ring_e2e62f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an energy ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(magic shield)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by knights, paladins and monks.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The Energy Ring provides a <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> for 10 minutes. Each point of damage taken while wearing it consumes 2x the amount of mana. Taking damage while wearing this ring will consume mana, but it does not progress magic level.\n</p><p>Obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/draconia-quest\">Draconia Quest</a> and the <a href=\"#/quest/demona-ring-quest\">Demona Ring Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Since the Vocation Adjustments Update 2020, only <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knights</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> could wear this ring.</li>\n<li>Since the Monk Vocation Update in April 2025, <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">monks</a> can also use it.</li>\n<li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 increased the mana cost to 2 mana per 1 damage taken.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Albino%20Dragon\">Albino Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Feather\">Animated Feather</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Askarak%20Demon\">Askarak Demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Askarak%20Lord\">Askarak Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bellicose%20Orger\">Bellicose Orger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bruise%20Payne\">Bruise Payne</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dipthrah\">Dipthrah</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Elemental\">Energy Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enlightened%20of%20the%20Cult\">Enlightened of the Cult</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gelidrazah%20the%20Frozen\">Gelidrazah the Frozen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a></li>\n<li><a hre